# Abliterated Muse-Glimmer-30B (Meta, dense, Apache 2.0), for writing rounds.
# Weights: bartowski's Q4_K_M of darkc0de's Heretic abliteration. Sampling is
# Meta's published recommendation, the same for every use. The window matches
# the coders': a dense 30B model reads slowly on this machine, and a longer
# conversation would take hours to re-read after a pause.
FROM hf.co/bartowski/darkc0de_Muse-Glimmer-30B-heretic-GGUF:Q4_K_M
# Ollama's own handling of this model's reply format, thinking and tool calls, as
# its library copy of Muse-Glimmer uses. Left to guess from the file, Ollama made
# a template whose stop words ended every reply after its first three tokens.
RENDERER glimmer
PARSER glimmer
# Replaces the stop words inherited from the file: only the end of a turn.
PARAMETER stop "<|eot|>"
PARAMETER num_ctx 65536
PARAMETER temperature 1.0
PARAMETER top_p 0.95
PARAMETER top_k 64
